{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1423448001:1":{"text":"子どもが好きそうな食べ物を買いたいのですが……このお金で買える分だけお願いします。","source_cn":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA799C0932FF7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423448002:1":{"text":"お客さん、申し訳ないけど、それっぽっちじゃ、せいぜいパンが二個買えるくらいですよ。","source_cn":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE14410FC8C90B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423448003:1":{"text":"情勢が変わって、王都じゃ物価が偉く上がっちゃってるんですよ。","source_cn":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008FEF05976EF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423448004:1":{"text":"でも、子どもたちに配るには、二個じゃ全然足りません……","source_cn":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47708CF89BA5723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423448005:1":{"text":"確か、オルディン村で作っているパンは、大きくて美味しくて、ここよりも安かったはずです……","source_cn":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E75AE7E47944842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423448006:1":{"text":"司祭さん、私たちがオルディン村に行って聞いてきます！そこなら、多めに買えるかもしれません！","source_cn":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3E9ACDBE3F1BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423448007:1":{"text":"ありがとうございます！お金を渡しますので、なるべくたくさん買ってきてくださいね。","source_cn":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD454DF30A6F1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"優しい司祭","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"ずる賢い食品商人","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}